        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-09-08T21:34:27.464Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is one of the best comic covers ever. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> I was legitimately so excited for this episode!</p>\n<p>“Espresso” is a real banger, no lie.</p>\n<p>The teenage Freedom Five story sounds great though.</p>\n<p>Skeleton Key mentioned <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/eyes.png?v=12\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> If only!</p>\n<p>Man, this is silly and incredibly fun. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Gosh, thanks for the kind words, You from the Future!</p>\n<p>\"Setback. “Guise.” Incredible moment XD</p>\n<p>No, this bit is perfectly fine, please continue.</p>\n<p>Okay, so headcanon is Tyler, Jr. and Meyer then. :V</p>\n<p>I think I can happily say this episode lived up to the hype. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2026-09-08T21:34:27.464Z",
