        "user_title": "",
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "This is one of the best comic covers ever. :D I was legitimately so excited for this episode!\n\n\"Espresso\" is a real banger, no lie.\n\nThe teenage Freedom Five story sounds great though.\n\nSkeleton Key mentioned :eyes: If only!\n\nMan, this is silly and incredibly fun. :D\n\nGosh, thanks for the kind words, You from the Future!\n\n\"Setback. \"Guise.\" Incredible moment XD\n\nNo, this bit is perfectly fine, please continue.\n\nOkay, so headcanon is Tyler, Jr. and Meyer then. :V\n\nI think I can happily say this episode lived up to the hype. :)",
